  "description": "Our 6061 Series 2 hydroformed and custom butted aluminium frame is matched to our tried and tested long, slack and low geometry to provide the ultimate ride.\nLSL means you'll be more stable at speed in the straights, have a lower centre-of-gravity in the turns for added grip and more room to manoeuvre when the trail turns steep.\nWith a mullet set-up this thing is fun tearing up the loam, slicing through slop or taking on the bikeparks. There's no trail the Mantra can't call home.\nA 140mm Rockshox RK35 Silver fork sits proudly up front and features Fast Black uppers and a Turn Key Lockout control to make life easy and get you ripping!\nShimano's Deore 12-speed drivetrain and SLX rear derailleur shifts across a wide-range 10-51 cassette, making light work of the climbs, before reaping the rewards on the way back down.\nSlam the 150mm KS Rage dropper as you plummet and use the Shimano Deore hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors to keep everything under control.\nGrip is handled by the trail-standard Maxxis Minion DHRII tyres, with RaceFace 35mm bar and stem for ultimate stiffness and control.\nBest of all, the rims and tyres are tubeless ready.\nPlease note - the Saracen Mantra does not come supplied with pedals. Add some from our gear store!",
